# M3 Frametime — dedicated Minecraft on 8 GB Apple Silicon (preferred)
# Quit Cursor/Chrome/Discord first. Unified memory: -Xmx only caps Java heap;
# Metal/GL/Sodium live outside it. SoftMax keeps working set under Xmx.
# Prefer ≤3G; NEVER 4096M / -Xmx4G — swap thrashing kills 1% lows.
# Prefer ARM64 Temurin/Zulu 21 — NEVER Rosetta/x86_64 Java.
# Do NOT set -XX:ActiveProcessorCount=… — that caps M-chip cores.

-Xms1536M
-Xmx2560M
-XX:SoftMaxHeapSize=2048M
-XX:+UseZGC
-XX:+ZGenerational
-XX:+AlwaysPreTouch
-XX:+DisableExplicitGC
-XX:NmethodSweepActivity=1
-XX:+PerfDisableSharedMem
-Djava.awt.headless=true
